<title>HUNGARY: Generali Hungary unit to sell travel insurance arm.</title>
<headline>Generali Hungary unit to sell travel insurance arm.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Generali Budapest Biztosito Rt said on Wednesday it was negotiating with German and Austrian investors on the sale of most of its 74 percent stake in travel insurance company Europai Utazasi Biztosito Rt (EUB).</p>
<p>&quot;The potential buyers are Europaische Reiseversicherung AG of Vienna and Europaische Reiseversicherung AG of Munich,&quot; Generali said in a statement, adding that it wishes to sell the shares above nominal value.</p>
<p>Generali added it was selling the stake in the hope that the strategic investors would integrate EUB into the international travel insurance network.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
